[*][url=https://github.com/no84by/frostpunk-dev-menu/blob/main/dev_menu.py]dev_menu.py[/url]: the installer (about 300 lines of Python, with comments)
[*][url=https://github.com/no84by/frostpunk-dev-menu#how-it-works]How it works[/url]: the Lua hook and the game's archive format, for anyone who wants to study it or build their own mods
[*][url=https://github.com/no84by/frostpunk-dev-menu/blob/main/docs/dev-panel.md]Panel reference[/url]: every button
[*][url=https://github.com/no84by/frostpunk-dev-menu/issues]Issues[/url]: bug reports and corrections welcome
[/list]

